<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group Holdings begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group Holdings begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said Tuesday it started coverage of Sabre Group Holdings Inc with an add rating and a $35 per share price target.</p>
<p>-- The firm said its 1997 earnings estimate was $1.62 per share and its 1998 estimate was $1.82 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Timothy Ross said core earnings continued to be dominated by maturing North American markets, but income from information-technology should show robust growth.</p>
<p>-- The stock added 3/8 to 31-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
